<title>UK: L-Bank sets $250 mln three-year bond.</title>
<headline>L-Bank sets $250 mln three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   L-BANK</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     6.25 PCT  MATURITY    18.JUL.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.1575  PAY DATE    18.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.97     SPREAD	FLAT</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
